I just want to put in my 2c against this tide of out-of-character suggestions.
Here are the precedents I can think of:

  * Quantum Mechanics are fine - they got into the dungeon by some strange
     power we don't understand.

  * Tourists, cameras, PYEC... at least there is a compile-time option to
     keep that out.

  * Kops, rubber hoses... I can handle a bit of slapstick.

  * Soldiers... they got into the dungeon through some secret military
     experient gone crazy.

But characters out of modern-day teen-killer movies?  I think that's
stretching the fabric of NH space-time a bit much! 

I like to see mythical characters and items in NH.  I consider Tolkein
in the "myth" class.


